Subject: [AROS] Owner-task socket adapter for polling 3.11.0

Scope: exact published crate; private x86_64 ABIv11 networking consumer.
Use the accepted libc-aros boundary and Exec notifications. Other targets
retain their upstream paths. AROS numeric IPv4, local Async handles only;
unsupported DNS, Unix sockets and worker-task I/O are not enabled.

